loud run copies downloads within 10 s instead of holding the browser up to 300 s per pass.\n- `ActionResult` drops and warns about every ignored 0.x field, not only the first (#6379).\n\nPR: https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use/pull/6383\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"Launch HN: Browser Use (YC W25) – open-source web agents","url":"https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=43173378","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2025-02-25","points":259,"comments":100},{"title":"Show HN: Browser-Use MCP for Claude that works without an API key","url":"https://twitter.com/vortex_ape/status/1900953901588729864","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=43617033","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2025-04-07","points":4,"comments":0},{"title":"Show HN: Browser-use, Qwen 2.5 3B, Sentience – Jest assertions for AI web agents","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46617496","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46617496","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2026-01-14","points":1,"comments":1},{"title":"Browser Use：11.5w star 的 AI 浏览器自动化项目，搜索/填表/CSV导出全自动化，GitHub项目地址","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/muyeseocom/article/details/169366605","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-11-06"},{"title":"GitHub CopilotがVS Code内でブラウザ操作に対応、AIエージェントがウェブアプリを開いて検証可能に","url":"https://gigazine.net/news/20260702-github-copilot-browser-use/","source":"GIGAZINE","lang":"zh","date":"2026-07-02"},{"title":"GitHub Browser-Use 部署踩坑实录：从安装到失败的完整避坑指南","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_28677451/article/details/159225324","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-03-18"},{"title":"GitHub Browser-Use 的部署失败记录：失败了，失败了。。。。","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/2501_90561511/article/details/150264991","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2025-08-12"},{"title":"不再只是爬蟲！Browser Use 讓 AI「讀懂」網站，四天開發成開源焦點","url":"https://technews.tw/2025/04/06/ai-agent-browser-use/","source":"TechNews 科技新報","